## Stop conditions for all agents

Stop and surface to the user (do not continue) if:

- A TRD is missing when implementation is about to start.
- The PRD or TRD conflicts with `docs/architecture.md`.
- Implementation requires a new dependency not already in the project.
- Tests fail twice in a row — do not auto-fix by changing the tests.
- An architectural deviation is needed — surface it, never silently diverge.
- Any of the package/module boundary rules would be violated.
- Any of the non-negotiable engineering rules cannot be followed.
